{"id":"27ae6ad867a7007d","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-omega1.md","title":"First Uncountable Ordinal","display":"df-omega1 — First Uncountable Ordinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-omega1","aliases":["58-df-omega1"],"display":"df-omega1 — First Uncountable Ordinal","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-injective.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-omega1"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-omega1</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-omega1 — First Uncountable Ordinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8317eefb4572709e\" href=\"?note=8317eefb4572709e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-injective.md\">../batch15/58-df-injective.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>（序数类，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>（最小无限序数，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Injective}(f,\\alpha,\\omega)\">\\(\\operatorname{Injective}(f,\\alpha,\\omega)\\)</span>（从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 的单射谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span>（此处定义的第一不可数序数）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega1} \\vdash \\omega_1\\coloneqq\\min\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\\neg\\exists f\\;\\operatorname{Injective}(f,\\alpha,\\omega)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega1} \\vdash \\omega_1\\coloneqq\\min\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\\neg\\exists f\\;\\operatorname{Injective}(f,\\alpha,\\omega)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega1\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash \\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(\\alpha&lt;\\omega_1\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\;\\operatorname{Injective}(f,\\alpha,\\omega))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega1\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash \\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(\\alpha&lt;\\omega_1\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\;\\operatorname{Injective}(f,\\alpha,\\omega))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 的单射刻画可数性，同时正确处理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha=0\">\\(\\alpha=0\\)</span>；原来的“存在从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 的满射”在空序数处失败，会错误地令最小值为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-injective.md","status":"resolved","id":"8317eefb4572709e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-injective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ord}$（序数类，见 [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\omega$（最小无限序数，见 [[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Injective}(f,\\alpha,\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"te